# =============================================================================
#  Ozhidaemye znachenija dlja ULQ2003A_test.cir
#  Istochnik: onsemi ULN2003A/D Rev.1 June 2025, str.3
#  Podrobno o tom, otkuda kazhdaja cifra - v TEST_README.md
#
#  Uglov DVA: 1 = kolonka Typ, 2 = kolonka Max.
#  Kolonok po temperature v dashite ULQ2003A net.
#
#  rezhimy: abs / rel / max / min - sm. README.md v korne biblioteki
# =============================================================================
# izmerenie      rezhim  dopusk   ugol1    ugol2
ECHO_CORNER      abs     0.1      1        2
B1_VCESAT100     abs     0.02     0.85     1.10
B2_VCESAT200     abs     0.02     0.95     1.30
B3_VCESAT350     abs     0.02     1.10     1.60
B4_IION          abs     0.02m    0.93m    1.35m
B5_TON           abs     20n      250n     1000n
B6_TOFF          abs     20n      250n     1000n
B7_VFCLAMP       abs     0.02     1.50     2.00
